ck retained; isFactory and badges are platform fields","evidence_ids":[]}]},{"id":"supplier-70003","original_source_ref":"alibaba:company:70003","evidence_id":"rart_ali_prod_c","observed_at":"2026-09-05T08:20:00.000Z","linked_product_ids":["product-90003"],"moq":{"value":300,"unit":"set","condition":"listing minimum","evidence_state":"observed_listing","evidence_id":"rart_ali_prod_c","source_ref":"alibaba:product:90003","observed_at":"2026-09-05T08:20:00.000Z"},"sample":{"quantity":null,"price":null,"currency":null,"unit":"set","timing":"7-10 days","condition":"listing: available, price not stated","evidence_state":"observed_listing","evidence_id":"rart_ali_prod_c","source_ref":"alibaba:product:90003","observed_at":"2026-09-05T08:20:00.000Z"},"lead_time":{"min_days":20,"max_days":20,"kind":"production","start_condition":"unknown","quantity_min":1,"quantity_max":1000,"evidence_state":"observed_listing","evidence_id":"rart_ali_prod_c","source_ref":"alibaba:product:90003","observed_at":"2026-09-05T08:20:00.000Z"},"capabilities":[],"qualifications":[],"gaps":["no quote","price per set in CN¥; set composition unknown","lead time listed only up to 1,000 sets","capability unverified"],"disposition":"hold_for_evidence","reasoning":["different unit and currency; not comparable to the other two"],"criterion_outcomes":[{"criterion_id":"supplier-capability","outcome":"unknown","reason":"no verification check retained; isFactory and badges are platform fields","evidence_ids":[]}]}],"verification_ledger":[{"claim":"Company 70001 manufactures silicone products in-house","candidate_id":"supplier-70001","evidence_ids":[],"status":"proposed"},{"claim":"Company 70002 manufactures silicone products in-house","candidate_id":"supplier-70002","evidence_ids":[],"status":"proposed"},{"claim":"Company 70003 manufactures silicone products in-house","candidate_id":"supplier-70003","evidence_ids":[],"status":"proposed"}],"rfq":{"status":"unsent","questions":["70001 (quote Q-2026-091 expires 2026-10-10): extend validity or reissue; quote the 26 cm variant at 2,000; EXW alongside FOB; reconcile lead time 25 days (listing) vs 30-35 days after deposit; retail box option and price; silicone food-contact test report for the exact material","70002: quote 2,000 pcs, 24 cm foldable silicone colander, grey, logo print, polybag, FOB Ningbo, USD, with validity date; confirm the trade basis of the USD 1.15 tier; are you the factory or a trading company, and who moulds it; sample price and terms; lead time at 2,000 pcs and its start condition; food-contact test report","70003: how many pieces and which sizes are in one set; can you supply a single 24 cm or 26 cm colander; quote 2,000 pcs (or the set equivalent) in USD, FOB Ningbo, with validity; lead time at that quantity (listed only to 1,000 sets); sample price and terms; food-contact test report"]}},"markdown":"# 硅胶沥水篮供应商对比（2,000 件 → 西班牙）\n\n覆盖状态：partial。观察日期：listing 2026-09-05，报价 2026-09-10；报告日期 2026-10-08。\n\n## 结论：谁最便宜？现有证据无法判定\n\n三家的价格不在同一口径上，不能排名。\n\n| 供应商 | 价格 | 证据状态 | 口径 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 70001 | USD 1.28/件 x 2,000，仅 24 cm | 报价 quote:70001:Q-2026-091，有效至 2026-10-10 | FOB 宁波，logo 印刷，塑料袋 |\n| 70001 | USD 1.30/件（2,000-4,999 档） | listing alibaba:product:90001，待核实 | 贸易条款未知 |\n| 70002 | USD 1.15/件（1,000-2,999 档） | listing alibaba:product:90002，待核实 | 贸易条款未知，无报价 |\n| 70003 | CN¥ 16.5/套（1,000-2,999 档） | listing alibaba:product:90003，待核实 | 币种和单位均不同（套，每套件数未知），无报价 |\n\n- 数字最低的是 70002 的 USD 1.15，但它是未知口径的 listing 价，不能和 70001 的 FOB 报价比较。\n- 70001 是唯一可比的数字，且只是 FOB 宁波价，不含运费、关税、增值税、验货。\n- 70003 按套、以人民币标价，没有带日期的汇率来源，也不知道一套几件，未做换算。\n- 到西班牙的到岸成本无法计算：运费、关税、VAT、验货均无留存证据，cost_scenario 为空，缺失项已逐项列出。\n\n## 其他发现\n\n- 70001 的报价 2026-10-10 到期，距报告日只剩两天；报价只覆盖 24 cm。\n- 70001 交期冲突：listing 写 25 天（1-2,000 件），报价写付定金后 30-35 天。两条均保留；报价写明了起算条件，更具体。\n- 70002 的 isFactory 为 false，可能是贸易商。\n- 三家的 Verified Supplier 标记、isFactory 都只是平台标签，生产能力均未核实。\n- 70003 是 2 件套，是否符合单个 24-26 cm 沥水篮未知。\n\n## 待你决定\n\n选哪家供应商、是否发出询价、是否续报价，都由你决定；我没有联系任何供应商。最有价值的下一步是让 70002 和 70003 按 70001 的口径（2,000 件、24 cm、logo 印刷、塑料袋、FOB 宁波、USD、含有效期）报价。\n"}},"isError":false,"response":{"status":201,"artifact":{"id":"rart_report_col_supplier_01","version":1,"record_type":"report","report_kind":"product_supplier_research","created_at":"2026-09-18T08:00:00.000Z"}}}
